# Intelligent Customer Support Ticket Triage & Resolution Assistant

AWS-based AI-powered customer support automation system.

## Features

- Ticket Management
- Auto Classification
- RAG Responses
- Bedrock Agents
- Approval Workflowg
- Streamlit Dashboard

## Tech Stack

- API Gateway
- Lambda
- DynamoDB
- SQS
- S3
- Cognito
- Bedrock
- SNS
- CloudWatch
